. sort _nwmode _nwnode

. 
. * Project onto the women: the tie value is the number of events two women attended together
. nw2project davis, project(1) name(women)
----------------------------------------
  Projected network: women
  Level: 1
  Nodes: 18
  Ties: 278

. nwsummarize women
--------------------------------------------------
   Network name:  women
   Network id:  2
   Directed: false
   Valued: true
   Two-mode: false
   Nodes: 18
   Selfloop: false
   Edges: 139
   Minimum value:  0
   Maximum value:  7
   Density:  .908
   Temporal: false
   Provenance:  projected from network davis, mode 1 (woman), stat=minmax

. nwcommunity women, generate(group)
----------------------------------------
